# ilu, "ago" -- a POSTPOSITION, so it trails the number and unit it measures
# ("Wasalna hawn jumejn ilu", "we arrived here two days ago"), and it is
# invariant in that use.  The same surface heads a different lexeme, the
# person-inflected durative adverb that PRECEDES its duration ("Ili jumejn ma
# norqod", "I haven't slept in two days"; "Xmun ilu seba' xhur fil-ħabs").
# That sense needs agreement with a subject this engine has no way to read, so
# it is refused: the offset orders accept ilu only in trailing position, and a
# preposed ilu never yields an offset.  en.wiktionary.org, ilu; Unicode CLDR
# 47, mt dateFields.json, relativeTime-type-past.
ilu
